{"source":"BMKG — Peringatan Dini Cuaca (nowcast)","feed":"https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/rss.xml","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T00:36:23.432Z","alerts":[{"id":"2.49.0.1.360.0.2026.09.24.00.72.002","link":"https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/CSG20260924002_alert.xml","event":"Hujan Lebat dan Petir","headline":"Hujan Lebat disertai Petir di Sulawesi Tengah","description":"Hujan lebat disertai petir akan terjadi pada 24 September 2026, 08:20 WITA di sebagian wilayah Sulawesi Tengah, khususnya di AMPIBABO, BALAESANG, DAMPELAS, KASIMBAR, LABUAN, MANTIKULORE, PARIGI, PARIGI BARAT, PARIGI SELATAN, PARIGI TENGAH, PARIGI UTARA, SINDUE, SINDUE TOMBUSABORA, SINIU, TANANTOVEA, TAWAELI.\n Kondisi ini berpotensi menimbulkan dampak berupa jarak pandang berkurang, angin kencang, dan banjir lokal.\n Masyarakat dihimbau untuk tetap waspada, mengurangi aktivitas di luar ruangan, serta mengambil langkah-langkah pencegahan yang diperlukan guna menjaga keselamatan.\n Kondisi diperkirakan dapat berlangsung hingga 24 September 2026, 12:09 WITA.","impact":"jarak pandang berkurang, angin kencang, dan banjir lokal","severity":"Moderate","urgency":"Immediate","certainty":"Observed","sent":1790208480000,"effective":1790209200000,"expires":1790222940000,"infographic":"https://nowcasting.bmkg.go.id/infografis/CSG/2026/09/24/infografis.jpg","province":"Sulawesi Tengah","districts":{"primary":["AMPIBABO","BALAESANG","DAMPELAS","KASIMBAR","LABUAN","MANTIKULORE","PARIGI","PARIGI BARAT","PARIGI SELATAN","PARIGI TENGAH","PARIGI UTARA","SINDUE","SINDUE TOMBUSABORA","SINIU","TANANTOVEA","TAWAELI"],"extended":[]},"polygons":[[[0.337,120.058],[0.313,120.062],[0.31,120.062],[0.296,120.056],[0.283,120.058],[0.275,120.065],[0.275,120.075],[0.275,120.077],[0.263,120.083],[0.261,120.085],[0.256,120.088],[0.25,120.09],[0.25,120.092],[0.244,120.096],[0.236,120.093],[0.226,120.097],[0.226,120.098],[0.223,120.098],[0.223,120.098],[0.208,120.096],[0.207,120.096],[0.201,120.093],[0.198,120.091],[0.197,120.0